# The pinned vendor payload under third_party/usbip-win2-driver is hash-verified against its
# SHA256SUMS before it is packaged (xtask portable) and again at install time. Git's end-of-line
# conversion would rewrite the text files there and make that pin fail on any fresh checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true, so nothing under that directory is ever converted.
third_party/usbip-win2-driver/** -text
